  id: quest.act1.wardens
  title: Paying the Wardens
  giver: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ec4428bbdff2bfa3a15ad688555f7aa, type: 2}
  faction: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fba0a8fe9beb89c1f88b8c0dd2a76d54, type: 2}
  reason: The rites cost what they cost, and the parish has not paid them since the
    lamp went out. The Wardens are not a charity and have never pretended to be.
  complication: The fee is being collected twice, and the warden taking it knows
    that.
  availability: []
  stages:
  - Title: The fee
    Summary: Sixty gold, in his hand, before anything else happens.
    Objectives:
    - Kind: 6
      Description: Pay Perrin Ossel 60 gold
      Item: {fileID: 0}
      Npc: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ec4428bbdff2bfa3a15ad688555f7aa, type: 2}
